<title>SRI LANKA: Sri Lanka banks to open for one hour on Friday.</title>
<headline>Sri Lanka banks to open for one hour on Friday.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banks in Sri Lanka will open for one hour of business only on Friday due to local government elections, the Banks Association said on Thursday.</p>
<p>It said business hours will be limited to between 9.00 a.m. (0300 GMT) and 10.00 a.m instead of the usual 9.00 a.m to 2.30 p.m.</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
